# efi_binding_released: EFI binds the display parked at port 0 when EFI is created, and only then: created before any display it binds none; a display with a shared page is not parked (its guest display holds it), so EFI binds none either; releasing the bound display unbinds it, and a display on port 1 is never bound. Trace blocks make every present deterministic.
